          "why_it_matters": "Salvant's voice works less like a fixed jazz-vocal style than an instrument for taking songs apart and rebuilding their emotional logic. Pairing her again with Sullivan Fortner puts the focus on phrasing, harmonic reaction and the strange repertoire choices that make her sets feel composed in real time rather than delivered from a standards book.",
